# Aloe Alchemist: "When this card becomes plotted" sees every way a card becomes plotted, not only its own plot action (CR 702.170c):
# Bot2 casts Aloe Alchemist on turn 2 and Bot1 flashes in Aven Interrupter in response, whose enters trigger exiles the Aloe
# Alchemist spell and makes it plotted. Its ability, functioning in exile, triggers for its owner, Bot2 (CR 113.6k), who targets
# its own Memnite: a 4/3 with trample until end of turn. The Aloe Alchemist is plotted in exile, not in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl x3
Aven Interrupter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Aloe Alchemist
Island x16

